    ],
    "text": "FOREIGN EXCHANGE ACT, No. 12 OF 2017",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      62.25,
      428.17,
      525.43,
      439.24
    ],
    "text": "Regulations made under Section 29 read with Section 7 of the Foreign Exchange Act, No. 12 of 2017",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      452.17,
      539.88,
      499.24
    ],
    "text": "Heading F. of the Schedule IV of the Foreign Exchange (Classes of Capital Transactions in Foreign ExchangeCarried on by Authorized Dealers) Regulations No. 01 of 2017 published under the Gazette (Extraordinary) NotificationNo. 2045/56 dated 17th November 2017 specifying requirements related to Repatriation of Export Proceeds to SriLanka by Exporters of Goods, is hereby repealed and substituted with the following.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      64.05,
      512.17,
      539.87,
      535.24
    ],
    "text": "1. Every exporter of goods shall repatriate to Sri Lanka payments received for the exportation of goods within 180days from the date of exportation.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      64.05,
      548.17,
      539.9,
      571.24
    ],
    "text": "2. Every exporter of goods shall submit related documentary evidence on each exportation to the respective authorizeddealer or restricted dealer that receives the payment.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      64.05,
      584.17,
      539.91,
      619.24
    ],
    "text": "3. Central Bank shall have the right to introduce an appropriate mechanism to monitor compliance of exporters ofgoods with this requirement and also to institute actions against any non-compliance with the aforesaid requirementsof this Heading.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      632.17,
      534.79,
      681.16
    ],
    "text": "MANGALA SAMARAWEERA,Minister of Finance.Colombo,17th October, 2019.",
